-- a.talk: the join-block-deadline-tie case's Script. Its first member's
-- maxPending runs out with the Timeout Block around the Join.

on go
  try
    with timeout of 1 s
      wait for all
        ask stock to check "A1" and wait
        ask stock to check "B2" and wait
      end wait
    end timeout
  catch e
    return e
  end try
end go
